# Optimal Solution (Expected O(V+E))

## Main Observation

Weights are only

```
1

or

2
```

Suppose an edge has weight 2.

```
A --------2-------- B
```

Replace it by

```
A --1-- Dummy --1-- B
```

Example

Original

```
0 -----2----- 1
```

Transformed

```
0 --1-- D --1-- 1
```

Cost

```
1+1=2
```

Exactly same.

Now every edge has weight **1**.

Once every edge weight becomes **1**, shortest path is simply **BFS**.

